   "relation": "family"
  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "1": "Turtle and TriG are W3C Recommendations (1.1, 2014; 1.2 in Candidate Recommendation adds triple terms, reifiers and annotation syntax). N3 is specified by a W3C Community Group report (not a standard) and Tim Berners-Lee's original Design Issues note and Team Submission.",
  "0": "Official test manifests are in w3c/rdf-tests; every RDF toolkit (Jena, rdflib, N3.js, RDF4J, Oxigraph) has a Turtle/TriG parser; N3.js and EYE implement N3."
 },
